  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: a full VP9 decoder (libvpx v1.17.0 port) bit-exact on every libvpx test vector; VP9 encoder inter frames, tiles and parallel entropy coding; MP3 decoder and clean-room encoder; FLAC decoder and clean-room encoder; animated lossy and lossless WebP; MP4 / WebM / MKV file encoding with audio; no GPL or LGPL code (the FFmpeg-derived code was removed and rewritten clean-room); the SpawnDev package icon; SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.35. Full list: https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.Codecs/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
